    "detailed_description": "There's only one word that can adequately describe this bunny: hungry. The goal of each puzzle in <i>bunny hungry</i> is to rearrange the terrain so that the bunny has a safe path of grass and dirt to reach the food. Every time you place a piece of terrain, all the tiles interact with their neighbors in consistent ways\u2014but you must discover those ways!<br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 80 original 9-by-9 puzzles<br></li><li> mouse-based pick-and-place interface<br></li><li> more than 10 types of terrain to discover<br></li><li> original music, artwork, and sound effects<br></li><li> customizable bunny appearance and food types<br></li><li> unlock-able level editor<br></li><li> optional move counter<br></li><li> discord server for community, support, and sharing custom levels</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "There's only one word that can adequately describe this bunny: hungry. The goal of each puzzle in <i>bunny hungry</i> is to rearrange the terrain so that the bunny has a safe path of grass and dirt to reach the food. Every time you place a piece of terrain, all the tiles interact with their neighbors in consistent ways\u2014but you must discover those ways!<br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 80 original 9-by-9 puzzles<br></li><li> mouse-based pick-and-place interface<br></li><li> more than 10 types of terrain to discover<br></li><li> original music, artwork, and sound effects<br></li><li> customizable bunny appearance and food types<br></li><li> unlock-able level editor<br></li><li> optional move counter<br></li><li> discord server for community, support, and sharing custom levels</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "How's bunny? ...bunny hungry! Move the terrain around, learn how it interacts, and make a safe path from the bunny to the food in this 2D puzzle game.",
